/2012/AVE-2012-0281.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0280","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0280.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3604","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 6.0 之前版本所使用的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造包含恶意代码的网页，当用户使用受影响版本的 Safari 浏览器访问该恶意网页时，WebKit 在处理网页内容过程中触发内存损坏，导致远程代码执行或应用程序拒绝服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 Safari 5.x 及更早版本、iOS 5.x 及更早版本的 Mac 及 iOS 设备，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重，攻击复杂度较低，无需用户交互即可在目标系统上执行任意代码。Apple 已在 2012 年 7 月发布的安全更新 Safari 6.0 和 iOS 6.0 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3604"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:33Z","remediation":"建议将 Mac 系统升级至 OS X Lion v10.7.4 或更高版本（内置 Safari 6.0），Apple 已通过改进 WebKit 内存处理机制修复该漏洞；iOS 设备需升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本。如暂无法升级，应避免访问不受信任的网站，并考虑在防火墙或代理层面过滤恶意 URL 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3604.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3604","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/osv/cve/2012/UBUNTU-CVE-2012-3604.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/vex/cve/2012/CVE-2012-3604.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-3604","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-3604","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blo