.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3600.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3600","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3600.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3600.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2012-3600.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3600.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-36xx/CVE-2012-3600.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ce2c8661ffd3fb6a28ed59c3d877961640a570d4/2012/CVE-2012-3600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0276.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0275","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0275.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3599","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Safari 6.0 之前的 Apple Safari 浏览器所使用的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问一个特制恶意网页来触发该漏洞，导致应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务）或在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响运行旧版本 Safari 的 macOS 和 iOS 设备，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在网络可达条件下完成利用。Apple 已在 2012 年 7 月发布的安全更新中将 Safari 升级至 6.0 版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3599"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:32Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple Safari 升级至 6.0 或更高版本，macOS Lion 系统同步升级至 OS X v10.7.4，macOS Mountain Lion 升级至 OS X v10.8，以获取 WebKit 内存损坏问题的官方补丁。临时缓解措施包括：启用 Safari 安全浏览功能、禁用自动打开\"安全\"文件下载选项、避免访问未知网站，或在网络边界部署 Web 应用防火墙拦截恶意网页请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c67c7954c46b752d4b167913e3e046ed998744d0/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3599.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3599","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3599.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3599.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3599.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3599.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2012-3599.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3599.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-35xx/CVE-2012-3599.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/52862ce9daccf736821f