渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，在用户仅使用受影响版本的Safari访问该页面时触发WebKit内存损坏，进而实现任意代码执行或导致浏览器应用程序崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响Safari 6.0之前的所有版本，攻击向量为网络远程，攻击复杂度中等，无需身份认证，攻击者仅需诱导用户打开恶意网站即可完成利用，对系统机密性、完整性和可用性均造成严重影响，CVSS评分为9.3。Apple于2012年7月25日在Safari 6.0安全更新中修复了该漏洞，通过改进WebKit内存处理机制消除了此缺陷。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3594"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:32Z","remediation":"升级 Mac 系统至 OS X Lion v10.7.4 或更高版本以获取 Safari 6.0，iOS 设备升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本，Windows 用户将 iTunes 升级至 10.7 或更高版本。通过系统软件更新或 Mac App Store 自动安装安全更新。如暂时无法升级，可改用其他浏览器访问网页，避免使用 Safari 打开不受信任的网站链接，并禁用不必要的 WebKit 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/52138c35bcb0784b4efb0e41fb1e599736d809a9/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3594.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3594","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3594.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3594.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3594.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3594.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2012-3594.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3594.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-35xx/CVE-2012-3594.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/343a9c8af3f97395548d45562cf85cc26422f7cd/2012/CVE-2012-3594.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0270.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0269","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0269.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3593","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WebKit 作为 Apple Safari 的核心渲染引擎，在 6.0 版本之前存在多处内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向用户推送特制的网页内容，在用户使用受影响版本的 Safari 浏览器访问该网页时触发这些漏洞。漏洞源于 WebKit 在处理网页元素、图像（TIFF/PNG/JPEG）及 HTTP 头时的内存管理缺陷，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用。成功利用可导致远程代码执行或应用程序崩溃，影响范围包括 Mac OS X 上的 Safari 6.0 之前版本以及 iOS 6.0 之前的移动设备。攻击条件要求目标用户访问恶意网站，且攻击者可通过网络远程发起攻击。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3593"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:32Z","remediation":"将 Safari 浏览器升级至 6.0 或更高版本（同时安装 OS X Lion 10.7.5 或 OS X Mountain Lion 10.8.2 系统更新），以修复 WebKit 内存破坏漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时使用其他浏览器访问不可信网站，并避免点击陌生链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3593.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3593","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3593.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402a